  "details": "Currently, the Banner's UI has both the group's name and ID in it, this looks very dense and clunky compared to the rest of the UI.\n\nI request having the group's ID show in the player selection menu as a button, where clicking it would copy the ID into the clipboard or just open the group's page.\n\nIn the end, the top banner would only show the name of the group and the image.\n\nSome extra ideas:\n\n- Clicking the banner itself with the laser pointer opens the group's page.\n\n-",
